      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and welcoming grooming team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers regularly highlight the friendly and accommodating attitude of groomers Rogério, Isabella, and the team. Visitors appreciate that staff listen closely to grooming preferences, maintain clear communication throughout the appointment, and treat every visiting pet with warmth and dedication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 38,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled grooming and coat transformations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners consistently praise the salon for neat haircuts, thorough wash-and-dry treatments, and lovely finishing accessories. Clients report that their pets emerge looking handsome, smelling great, and sporting perfectly styled coats, whether undergoing routine maintenance or a breed-specific show style."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous clients emphasize how calm and relaxed their pets remain during and after grooming sessions. Pet owners with nervous rescue dogs, elderly pets, and cats particularly value the patient approach, noting that animals feel secure and happy rather than stressed during their appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
